# Test Structure Override

`tests/invariants/` is a cross-cutting directory for Hypothesis-based property tests that verify domain invariants (allocation sums, balance non-negativity, schedule identities, sequential coverage). These tests exercise the full stack rather than a single module, so they do not need to mirror a specific source directory.
